#: content/seeds/the-chefs/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> A group of cooks, dietitians, and teachers are tasked with both creating and promoting well-rounded and tasty vegetarian cuisine in a world living through the culture shock of no affordable meat.\n"
